\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 This led to the development of a SQLite-based memory system with full-text search and project-scoped retrieval.\
Memory transformed the system from a chatbot into something closer to an assistant.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs28 \cf0 Learning Layer\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 The Learning Layer remains the most ambitious part of the vision.\
Its purpose is not merely remembering information.\
Its purpose is improving behavior.\
Questions include:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls4\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 What worked?\
